# Scale Up Web Infrastructure

## Overview

This architecture improves the availability, scalability,
and performance of www.foobar.com.

The infrastructure includes:
- Two HAProxy load balancers in a high-availability cluster
- Two dedicated Nginx web servers
- Two dedicated application servers
- One MySQL Primary database server
- One MySQL Replica database server

